[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15361.469, "timestamp": "04:16:01", "text": "嗯，是紫水晶，但不是那种紫水晶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15365.79, "timestamp": "04:16:05", "text": "有创造力的。这些沙子和东西来自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15369.389, "timestamp": "04:16:09", "text": "那个卑鄙无耻的人。我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15372.59, "timestamp": "04:16:12", "text": "它。呃，杀了这些。"}]